<!-- YOUR JOURNEY -->
<section class="section-white" aria-labelledby="journey-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-up" style="max-width:680px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">What to Expect</span>
      <h2 id="journey-heading" class="section-heading">Your Path to a Permanent Smile</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <p>We don't hand you a treatment plan on the first call. We start with a conversation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl);">
      <div class="step fade-up">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Initial Consultation</h3>
          <p>You meet with {{ site.doctorName }} to talk through your goals, concerns, and history. No pressure, no upsell.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step fade-up">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Imaging &amp; Planning</h3>
          <p>3D cone-beam imaging gives us a precise picture of your bone structure and anatomy. We build a surgical plan around your specific situation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step fade-up">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Treatment Day</h3>
          <p>Sedation options ensure you are comfortable. For many full-arch patients, teeth are placed the same day as surgery.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step fade-up">
        <div class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">4</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Healing &amp; Final Restoration</h3>
          <p>Osseointegration — the process of implants fusing with bone — takes a few months. Once complete, your final restorations are placed. Built to last.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

